item.description:
Webhook subscription management for real-time event delivery. Providers can subscribe to 35 event types across 10 categories (case, referral, appointment, prescription, insurance, injury, note, diagnosis, billing, document). Each delivery is signed with HMAC-SHA256; verify the X-CaseXchange-Signature header using your subscription secret.

**Supported event types:**
- case.created, case.updated, case.archived
- referral.sent, referral.accepted, referral.rejected, referral.withdrawn, referral.in_treatment, referral.treatment_complete
- appointment.created, appointment.updated, appointment.deleted
- prescription.created, prescription.updated, prescription.deleted
- insurance.created, insurance.updated, insurance.deleted
- injury.created, injury.updated, injury.deleted
- note.created, note.updated, note.deleted
- diagnosis.created, diagnosis.updated, diagnosis.deleted
- billing.created, billing.updated, billing.deleted
- document.uploaded, document.deleted
- webhook.test

